libcxi-cxidb
------------------------------------------
Library to help read and write CXI files

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcxi-cxidb-devel-0+git20150813-1bl3
  libcxi-cxidb0-0+git20150813-1bl3
  libhdf5_320-2.2.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  hdf5-2.2.0-1
  libaec-devel-1.1.8-1
  libhdf5-devel-2.2.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/cxidb/libcxi

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/cxidb/libcxi.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libcxi-cxidb-0+git20150813-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libcxi-cxidb-0+git20150813-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libcxi-cxidb-0+git20150813-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcxi-cxidb-0+git20150813-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcxi-cxidb0-0+git20150813-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcxi-cxidb-devel-0+git20150813-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libcxi-cxidb)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libcxi-cxidb.README
  /usr/share/doc/libcxi-cxidb/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libcxi-cxidb/README.md

(libcxi-cxidb0)
  /usr/bin/cygcxi-cxidb-0.dll

(libcxi-cxidb-devel)
  /usr/include/cxi.h
  /usr/lib/libcxi-cxidb.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libcxi-cxidb.pc

